   "unique": 12,
   "top": {
    "Gwaneumpoman in Namhae-gun is a place where the spirit of the patriotic spirit of Admiral Yi Sun-sin of the Joseon Dynasty and Jeong Ji-jeong of the Goryeo Dynasty lives and breathes.This festival presents a wave of rapeseed oil spread over 20,000 square meters along the lyrical Gwaneumpo bank road, which is steeped in the warm rural atmosphere of the Namhae, to the Sangchun visitors to the South Sea.": 1,
    "A collaboration of fragrant coffee scent that harmonizes with the beautiful natural environment of Namhae!This festival, hosted by the Treasure Island Barista Association and held on the lawn of Namsan Park behind the Namhae Indoor Gymnasium, promotes Namhae-gun as an item called coffee to visitors to the festival site, as well as direct communication with local residents and a free coffee sharing event to live a life of sharing. It is made into a space of practical practice and presents the harmony of fragrant music along with various experiential activities such as coffee roasting experience and latte art demonstration.": 1,
    "The taste of Treasure Island Namhae!The Changseon Bracken Samhap Festival will be held for the 4th time this year in the Living Sports Park in order to promote the taste and reputation of the Namhae-gun Changseon Bracken, which boasts the highest quality and the largest production area in Korea.The harmony of bracken, mussels and clams grown in the clean natural environment of Namhae-gun is enough to captivate the taste of tourists.A variety of attractions, food and experience events along with the warm atmosphere of late spring make this festival even richer.Let's make the first chapter of a happy trip at the Bracken Samhap Festival held in Changseon, Namhae, a treasure island where fresh seafood, healthy people, and nature like a watercolor are all in harmony!": 1,
    "Treasure Island Namhae Galhwa King Shrimp Festival, held since 2017, presents a feast of fun festivals with various dishes using crayfish (white legged shrimp) grown in the clear blue southern sea.This festival, which was prepared to promote the taste and excellence of white shrimp, which has been spotlighted as a new delicacy in the South Sea, attracts more than 10,000 gourmets every year.Let's start a delicious trip on Treasure Island Namhae with natural environment!": 1,
    "Nongak performance, prayer festival, writing wishes on Korean paper, gifting of products to participants in wish writing event, free food sharing, etc.": 1,
    "Celebration performance, water catfish food event, experience event, sunrise event (blow up wish balloons, etc.), etc.": 1,
    "Legend of KowloonWhat comes to mind when you look at the mountains and topography of Munhang Village, Seolcheon-myeon, Namhae-gun? Nine dragons immediately come to mind. For a long time, the villagers had never actually seen a dragon, but believed that nine dragons guarded the village.Villagers went to the island in time for the opening of the sea route to make a wish, and they used to pour their stories on the island as if complaining. People believed that the dragon was listening to their story. Naturally, the road leading to the island was called 'Wish Road'.Nine dragons, thought to be imaginary beings...were invisible to the naked eye, but lived on an island across the sea...Hearing their stories and passing them on to the sky, they were protecting Munhang Village.Nine Guardian Gods of the Village Dragon (Kowloon) I want to share asecret known only to the villagers at theSeolcheon-myeon Cham Oyster Festivalto convey the wishes of many people to the dragon...": 1,
    "“Ehera~ You are an anchovy genius”Fresh seafood caught daily by fighting the waves!A seagull sharing the joy of a million ships!The laughter of the fishermen as they break the waves vigorously!Korea's best beauty port full of energy for a healthy life!Mijo is an indigo sea resembling the sky and strange rocks that sit embracing the sea, 'Songjeong Solbaram Beach' with pine forest and silver sand, 'Moominsa' that commemorates the spirit of General Choi Young who gave his life for the country, and to protect the village from the sea wind. It is a beautiful place where natural monuments such as 'Namhae Mijo-ri Evergreen Forest', created as natural monument No. 29, and warm people live together as one.Treasure Island Mijohang Anchovy & Sea Festival held in Mijo, South Sea of ??Treasure Island, where nature such as anchovy sashimi, anchovy ssambap, fresh seafood, healthy people, and watercolors are in harmony. Let's start a happy trip with various sea experiences, sights and food.": 1,
    "In a war in which even the king abandoned the people and fled, the Japanese army advanced to the north in a ruthless manner. The fate of a country that was likely to become a Japanese colony. But the sea was unaffected. Because of the excellent tactical management of this Chungmugong. And he fell by the bullets of his enemies, and even before his death, he was worried about 'the country' rather than 'self'. “Now that the battle is in full swing, do not announce my death.” These words, which show the culmination of Lee Chung-mugong's patriotism, were gloriously none other than at the 'Battle of Noryang', the last battlefield of the Seven Years' War, off the coast of Noryang in the South Sea.In order to revive this extraordinary spirit of love for the country today, the 'Lee Chungmugong Noryang Naval Victory Ceremony' has been held for three days since 2001, around April 28, the birthday of Lee Chungmugong. The naval battle Seungcheopje' was held for three days before and after November 19 (lunar calendar) when Lee Chungmugong was killed to increase the historical value.In 2010, under the name of 'Reproduction of the Ungu Parade of Chungmugong Yi Sun-sin,' the ungu procession was reproduced for the first time in 412 years after undergoing historical verification. was changed to the 'Sun-Sin Admiralty International Exhibition', and since 2018, the event period has been moved to November to hold the Sun-Shin Yi Complete International Exhibition.": 1,
    "Held in a German village, the home of miners and nurses who contributed to the economic development of Korea from the 1960s to the 1970s.Namhae German Village Beer Festival is a unique festival where you can experience German culture and taste authentic German beer and sausage, based on the world's three largest festivals, Munich's Oktoberfest.The German Village Beer Festival, which was on the verge of stopping due to the prolonged COVID-19, will switch to an online international event and visit various online events, including the opening ceremony of the metaverse.": 1
